com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125880/extras/ffbb8a6c6c001c48cf39f57284bfe140.avif?t=1627995192\" /></div><br><br>LaserZone is a 2D game with a three-dimensional effect. It is built based on <u>Cycles Render</u> from Blender Cycles 3D Tool.<br><br>Thanks to Cycles Render's power, we have created a world brimming with futuristic artworks and Sci-Fi atmosphere.<br><br><br><i>* LaserZone uses free classic music as BGM, whose copyrights AND neighboring copyrights have expired.</i>",
